+# REPORT 06 — Status DONE
+
+Publishable package pipeline (release workflow, shared wheel smoke script, releasing doc).
+
+## Changes
+
+- `.github/workflows/release.yml` (new). `on: push: tags: ["v*"]` + `workflow_dispatch`;
+  top-level `permissions: contents: read`; `concurrency` per ref, no cancel; `UV_VERSION: "0.12.5"`.
+  - `build` (ubuntu, py3.12, 15 min): checkout (`persist-credentials: false`), setup-python, pip-install uv
+    (ci.yml style), **guard** (inline Python, `tomllib` + `ast`; refs via env, no `${{ }}` in the
+    script): fails with one `::error title=release guard::...` line unless `ref_type == tag`, tag ==
+    `v` + `[project].version`, and `src/arci/__init__.py` `__version__` == that version; then
